    "# 01: Reproduce Main Result\n",
    "\n",
    "**Cross-Language Functional-Equivalence Invariant Mining**\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook walks through the full pipeline end-to-end.\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Load the synthetic results (already computed via `run_synthetic_pipeline.py`)\n",
    "2. Generate CSV artefacts from results JSON\n",
    "3. Produce all 8 figures\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Note:** These figures use synthetic implementation data because LLM inference was unavailable.\n",
    "> The pipeline logic is fully validated. Replace `synthetic_results.json` with real output to obtain\n",
    "> empirically-grounded results."
   ]
